<panel>
  <div background-color="#000000cc" border-radius="16" padding="24" width="460" flex-direction="column" gap="8" align-items="center">
    <div font-size="24" font-weight="bold" color="#00ffff">HOW TO PLAY</div>
    <div height="6"></div>
    <div font-size="14" color="#cccccc">Fly through space fortresses,</div>
    <div font-size="14" color="#cccccc">destroy targets, and survive!</div>
    <div height="4"></div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#00aaaa">-- Controls --</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">A/D or Left/Right: Move laterally</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">W/S or Up/Down: Change altitude</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Space/E/K: Fire lasers</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Q/F: Launch missile</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">B: Smart bomb (clears screen)</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Esc/P: Pause</div>
    <div height="4"></div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#00aaaa">-- VR Controls --</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Right stick: Move laterally</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Left stick: Change altitude</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Right trigger: Fire</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">R squeeze / L trigger: Missile</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">A button: Smart bomb</div>
    <div height="4"></div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#ff8800">-- Tips --</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Fly over walls or through gaps</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Destroy fuel tanks for fuel</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Watch your altitude shadow</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Cloakers phase in/out - hit when visible!</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Asteroids block your path - shoot or dodge</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Sectors change every 3 levels</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Smart bombs clear the screen</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Check radar for nearby threats</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Destroy shield generators to clear force fields</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Carriers spawn fighters - destroy them fast!</div>
    <div font-size="12" color="#aaaaaa">Shoot down homing missiles or dodge!</div>
    <div height="8"></div>
    <div name="btn-tutorial-back" background-color="#444444" border-radius="8" padding="10" width="180" align-items="center" cursor="pointer">
      <div font-size="14" color="#aaaaaa">Back</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</panel>
